      "title": "FAQ",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FAQ\n\n**How do I use this??**\n\nI'll be posting tutorials on my YouTube channel soon!\n<https://www.youtube.com/@WhatDreamsCost/>\n\n**Where do I download these models??**\n\nThere is a good list of models and download links here: <https://github.com/wildminder/awesome-ltx2?tab=readme-ov-file>\n\nAlso the latest v1.1 spatial upscaler can be found here: <https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3/tree/main>\n\nThe tiny vae (taeltx2_3.safetensors) is found here:\n<https://huggingface.co/Kijai/LTX2.3_comfy/blob/main/vae/taeltx2_3.safetensors>\n\n**I'm getting errors when running this workflow!**\n\nDouble check that you have all of the correct models loaded. This is using the newest version of 2x upscaler (v1.1). You can change it to the older one under the Model Loader.\n\n**How can I support you?**\n\nHelp me get a job. I'm unemployed and literally broke. (seriously, i'll even scrub toilets for minimum wage)\n\nOr follow me on my socials :)\n\n<https://x.com/WhatDreamsCost>\n\n<https://www.instagram.com/whatdreamscost/>\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/@WhatDreamsCost/>\n"
      ],
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        453.1394268295555,
        3962.905300414684
      ],
      "size": [
        482.29156971307566,
        935.5364525572236
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Models",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.5.2",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# LTXV-2 Model Files & Dependencies\n\n**ltx-2.3-22b-distilled 1.1-Q5_K_M.gguf**  \n*Place in:* `unet`\n\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-1.1 Q5_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/LTX-2.3-GGUF/blob/main/distilled-1.1/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-1.1-Q5_K_M.gguf)\n\n## Diffusion Model\n**LTXV-2.3-22b DISTILLED 1.1 FP8**  \n*Place in:* `diffusion_models`\n\n- [ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-1.1_transformer_only_mxfp8_block32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/LTX2.3_comfy/blob/main/diffusion_models/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled-1.1_transformer_only_mxfp8_block32.safetensors)\n\n\n**Sulphur 2 mxfp8**  \n*Place in:* `diffusion_models`\n\n- [sulphur2Mxfp8_sulphurMxfp8Distil.safetensors](https://civitai.red/api/download/models/2915654?fileId=2794287)\n\n---\n\n## Text Encoder\n**Gemma-3-12b-it-IQ4_XS.gguf**  \n*Place in:* `text_encoders`\n\n- [gemma-3-12b-it-IQ4_XS.gguf](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-3-12b-it-GGUF/resolve/main/gemma-3-12b-it-IQ4_XS.gguf?download=true)\n\n---\n\n## Dual CLIP Connector\n**LTX-2.3-22b-distilled_embeddings_connector**  \n*Place in:* `text_encoders`\n\n- [LTX-2.3-22b-distilled_embeddings_connectors.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/LTX-2.3-GGUF/blob/main/text_encoders/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled_embeddings_connectors.safetensors)\n\n---\n\n## Audio VAE\n**LTX2.3-22b-distilled_audio_vae.safetensors**  \n*Place in:* `checkpoints`\n\n- [LTX2.3-22b-distilled_audio_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/LTX-2.3-GGUF/blob/main/vae/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled_audio_vae.safetensors)\n\n---\n\n## Video VAE\n**LTX-2.3-22b-distilled_video_vae.safetensors**  \n*Place in:* `vae`\n\n- [LTX-2.3-22b-distilled_video_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/LTX-2.3-GGUF/blob/main/vae/ltx-2.3-22b-distilled_video_vae.safetensors)\n\n\n---\n## LoRAs\n*Place in:* `loras`\n\n**LTX 2.3 - I2V T2V Video Reasoning lora VBVR**  \n\n- [I2V T2V Video Reasoning lora VBVR.safetensors](https://civitai.red/api/download/models/2848299?fileId=2734400)\n\n**LTX-2.3-Transition-LORA**  \n\n- [ltx2.3-transition.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/joyfox/LTX-2.3-Transition-LORA/blob/main/ltx2.3-transition.safetensors)\n\n**LTX2.3-IC-LORA-Dual-Character\n**  \n\n- [LTX2.3-IC-LORA-Dual-Character.safetensors](https://civitai.red/api/download/models/2810376?fileId=2696156)\n\n**LTX_2.3_Paper_Cut_Out_Style_LoRa **  \n\n- [LTX_2.3_Paper_Cut_Out_Style_LoRa .safetensors](https://huggingface.co/vrgamedevgirl84/LTX_2.3_Paper_Cut_Out_Style_LoRa/blob/main/PaperCutOutStyle.safetensors)\n\n\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
